				Time="2011-11-12T06:36:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>機動隊員『総員！
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]クノイチを　確保しろ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
