		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>メカポリス『[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="0" ]クノイチ
待てー！　待たんかー！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-25T02:02:47" />
